            "block_content": "(m) Cost of Living Increases – Regular full-time and regular part-time employees on the active payroll as of December 31, 1994 are eligible to receive annual cost of living adjustments on their pension benefits. Employees hired on or after January 1, 1995 are not eligible for cost of living adjustments on their pension benefits.",
